<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  RUT_Webwork_EggBlackMarket.xml    UtinniPatches · WEBWORK_EGG_BLACKMARKET_BUILD_1
  ============================================================================

  Moved here unchanged in behaviour from the cut mandrake.rut.shokkweaveeconomy
  (ShokkweaveEggBlackMarket.xml), owner Biome card 5 by card, 2026-10-22.
  §1d/§5 ruling 5 of design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/webwork_egg_blackmarket_2026-09-24.md.

  1) Tradeability: RM_OllathrixEgg (mandrake.rm.webwork, composed into
     mandrake.rm.biomes) ships an explicit <tradeability>Sellable</tradeability>
     in the free tier (no trader ever STOCKS it there, only nests do). The
     campaign layer opens it to All so `RUT_Caravan_HuttCartel_EggMarket` can
     stock it at all (`TraderCanSell()` is false for Sellable, TradeabilityUtility.cs).
     The PatchOperationConditional covers both shapes: Replace if the element
     exists, Add if it does not.

     Leak check (§5 ruling 5, "leak-checked at build against every live
     TraderKindDef"), MEASURED 2026-09-26 with RimSage against the installed
     1.6 source: the egg carries `<thingCategories>ResourcesRaw</thingCategories>`,
     and `StockGenerator_Category categoryDef=ResourcesRaw` is used by five
     vanilla/DLC TraderKindDefs (TraderKinds_Base_Outlander, _Base_Neolithic,
     _Orbital_Misc in Core; _Base_Empire, _Caravan_Empire in Royalty), none
     excluding it. `StockGenerator_Category.GenerateThings` filters on
     `tradeability.TraderCanSell()`, TRUE for All, so the flip alone would let
     those ordinary traders roll the black-market egg. The trade TAG route is
     clean: no StockGenerator_Tag in this repo names `RM_Contraband`.

     FIX: campaign-side, strip `ResourcesRaw` off the egg's `thingCategories`
     below. `StockGenerator_SingleDef.HandlesThingDef` is a bare defName match,
     so the Cartel kind's own stocking is untouched; the category-route traders
     can no longer see the egg. A player without the campaign layer keeps the
     free tier's ResourcesRaw-categorized, Sellable-only egg.

  2) The Cartel caravan kind is APPENDED to `RUT_Jawa_HuttCartel`'s own
     `caravanTraderKinds` (Defs/FactionDefs/JawaHuttCartel.xml, this mod,
     which already lists `RUT_Caravan_HuttCartel_Captives` the same way), so
     this Add appends alongside it rather than replacing the list.
  ============================================================================
-->
<!-- PATCH_MAYREQUIRE_GUARD_INERT_1: MayRequire on a top-level <Operation> is
     ignored by vanilla, so the three operations sit under one real
     PatchOperationFindMod on the composed biomes mod that carries the egg
     (this mod hard-depends on it today; the guard keeps the file load-safe
     if that ever changes). -->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods><li>RimMandrake: Baroque Biomes</li></mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_OllathrixEgg"]/tradeability</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_OllathrixEgg"]/tradeability</xpath>
            <value>
              <tradeability>All</tradeability>
            </value>
          </match>
          <nomatch Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_OllathrixEgg"]</xpath>
            <value>
              <tradeability>All</tradeability>
            </value>
          </nomatch>
        </li>

        <!-- The leak fix: pull RM_OllathrixEgg out of the ResourcesRaw
             category route (see the header note above) once it goes
             tradeability All. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="RM_OllathrixEgg"]/thingCategories/li[text()="ResourcesRaw"]</xpath>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="RUT_Jawa_HuttCartel"]/caravanTraderKinds</xpath>
          <value>
            <li>RUT_Caravan_HuttCartel_EggMarket</li>
          </value>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
